{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49067","headline":"秋日彭蠡湖中观庐山 · 吴筠","name":"秋日彭蠡湖中观庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泛舟太湖上，回瞰兹山隈。\n万顷沧波中，千峰郁崔嵬。\n凉烟发炉峤，秋日明帝台。\n绝巅凌大漠，悬流泻昭回。\n穹崇石梁引，岈豁天门开。\n飞鸟屡隐见，白云时往来。\n超然契清赏，目醉心悠哉。\n董氏出六合，王君升九垓。\n谁言旷遐祀，庶可相追陪。\n从此永栖托，拂衣谢浮埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}